Aerie-Purpose: Create the Aerie Guard page action controller for every tab that has the Aerie Guard action.
Aerie-Upstream-Area: chrome/browser/ui/tabs/tab_features.cc, chrome/browser/ui/tabs/public/tab_features.h, chrome/browser/ui/tabs/BUILD.gn
