Issue #99. The controller (overlay, chrome/browser/ui/views/aerie_adblock) shows the icon
on http and https pages, draws the blocked count into its image and keeps its tooltip and
accessible name. Modelled on JsOptimizationsPageActionController. Needs patches/adblock/0007
(it edits the same file next to the lines of the cosmetic tab helper).

